From: iEDA loongarch64 port <tsuibin@qq.com>
Subject: [PATCH] yaml-cpp: include cstdint explicitly for GCC 16

GCC 16 no longer includes <cstdint> transitively via the standard headers.
yaml-cpp's emitterutils.cpp uses uint16_t without including it, which breaks
compilation on AOSC OS with GCC 16.

diff --git a/src/third_party/yaml-cpp/src/emitterutils.cpp b/src/third_party/yaml-cpp/src/emitterutils.cpp
index 0113c45..bccb2a2 100644
--- a/src/third_party/yaml-cpp/src/emitterutils.cpp
+++ b/src/third_party/yaml-cpp/src/emitterutils.cpp
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
 #include <algorithm>
+#include <cstdint>
 #include <iomanip>
 #include <sstream>
 
